<title>BELGIUM: Trade in steelmaker Cockerill shares resumed.</title>
<headline>Trade in steelmaker Cockerill shares resumed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in the shares of Belgian steelmaker Cockerill Sambre was resumed on the Brussels bourse at 1340 (1240 GMT) following an announcement the firm was dropping partnership plans with fellow steelmaker UGB.</p>
<p>Trading was suspended before the bourse opened on Wednesday pending a statement from the firm.</p>
<p>The shares closed on Tuesday at 130 francs. They reopened one franc higher after the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
